        -:  272: *         object's predicate is `0 < v || unordered`.
        -:  273: *   %d    the integer part, `(int)fabs(v)`: `fld; fabs; fistpl` with the
        -:  274: *         control word set to truncate.
        -:  275: *   %06d  six fractional digits.  `fistl` leaves `(int)v` in memory WITHOUT
        -:  276: *         popping, `fildl` reads it back, and `de e2` -- FSUBRP, which
        -:  277: *         objdump prints as its own opposite (finding 245) -- computes
        -:  278: *         `v - (float)(int)v`, the ordinary fractional part, which is then
